    fields:  # cee3
      statement: "AnalysisRun.repo_fingerprint should identify the analyzed repository state at the time of the run, enabling cross-run identity ('was this the same repo, was it modified?'). Today it is None on 100% of 133 AnalysisRuns on hypergumbo's own behavior map."  # cee3
      root_cause: "The field is declared in the AnalysisRun dataclass and serialized into every analysis_runs[] entry, but no producer in the analyzer pipeline writes a non-None value. Same dead-field pattern as WI-fanun (Symbol.fingerprint), WI-bujim (features[]), WI-lonoz (Edge.quality) — schema field declared but no code path populates."  # cee3
